   "title": "Sick-day rules: prevent the next DKA or HHS",
   "items": [
    "type 1: keep SOME insulin even when not eating · check glucose AND urine ketones often",
    "type 2: check glucose often · STOP SGLT2 inhibitors, diuretics, metformin while vomiting or with diarrhea · some insulin is safe"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "From diagnosis",
   "items": [
    "refer: dietitian · diabetes nurse educator · optometrist",
